%% frame: UC9 B7: append a team price revision inside the terms transaction (design)
sequenceDiagram
    participant App as :TeamTermsAppServiceImpl
    participant Prices as :TeamPriceAppServiceImpl
    participant Repo as :ProductRepository
    participant Users as :UserAppService
    participant PRepo as :TeamPriceRepository
    create participant Pol as :TeamPricePolicy

    Note over App,PRepo: B7: joins the caller's transaction (10 s)
    App->>Prices: configure(productId, actorId, command)
    Prices->>Prices: lockProduct(productId)
    Prices->>Repo: lockById(productId): lock 1 again, already held
    Prices->>Users: requireActive(actorId)
    Prices->>PRepo: findLatestPolicy(productId)
    PRepo-->>Prices: Optional(TeamPricePolicy)
    break expectedVersion is not the latest policy version (E8)
        Prices-->>App: E8: TEAM_PRICE_VERSION_CONFLICT (CATALOG_412_001)
    end
    Prices->>PRepo: currentTime()
    Prices->>Pol: «create» (productId, amount, currency, validFrom, validUntil, currentVersion + 1)
    Prices->>Pol: requireCompatible(product)
    Prices->>Pol: requireStartableWindow(now)
    break not on sale, price not below the listing price, window past or too short (E8)
        Pol-->>Prices: E8: TEAM_PRICE_UNAVAILABLE (CATALOG_409_001) or TEAM_PRICE_INVALID (CATALOG_400_001)
        Prices-->>App: E8: BizException
    end
    Prices->>PRepo: appendPolicy(policy, actorId, now)
    Prices-->>App: TeamPricePolicy
